  "closed_findings": [
    "F01: Added @@unique([..., centerId]) on all 5 composite 1-to-1 models (Invoice, DiscountApproval, CreditNote, ReversalOrRefundExecution, Receipt) in schema.prisma + migration.sql; verified 0 P1012 relation errors.",
    "F02: Deleted handwritten apps/api/src/types/pg.d.ts, added @types/pg 8.23.1 and @types/node 24.13.6, un-excluded src/generated in apps/api/tsconfig.json, and wired real PrismaClient({ adapter: new PrismaPg(this.pool) }) + $disconnect() in DatabaseService.",
    "F03: Consolidated DatabaseService into a single provider in DatabaseModule.register() with API_CONFIG_TOKEN visible to DatabaseService.",
    "F04: Added exhaustive trailing throw in runInSerializableTransaction / runRetryableSerializableMock and replaced Buffer.concat in apps/api/test/health.test.ts with UTF-8 string accumulation.",
    "F05: Resolved migration paths relative to __dirname in harness.ts, created distinct Center B roles (eduerp_center_b_api, eduerp_center_b_worker, eduerp_center_b_readonly) with distinct-role guard in eduerp_apply_role_grants(), and added try/catch cleanup on harness bootstrap failure.",
    "F06: Switched harness.ts to invoke real 'prisma migrate deploy --config prisma.config.ts' CLI subprocess as eduerp_migrator, added dedicated one-shot migrator service in infra/compose.dev.yml, removed MIGRATION_DATABASE_URL from ApiEnvConfig and api container, and hardened /api/v1/ready to verify rolsuper=false, schema_owner=false, tgenabled!='D', and runtime ACLs with a static safe 503 message.",
    "F07: Expanded apps/api/test/database/*.integration.test.ts with 6-table financial rollback (DB-IT-11), negative disabled-trigger/dropped-constraint drift detection (DB-IT-04), additive S04->S05 upgrade row preservation (DB-IT-02-UPGRADE), full STAFF|SYSTEM_WORKER actor matrix (DB-IT-08/15/16/17), LEFT->reenroll and same-day occurrence_seq=1,2 (DB-IT-06), and bounded 40001 retry exhaustion (DB-IT-12).",
    "F08: Hardened eduerp_guard_last_active_director() with deterministic 'SELECT id FROM staff_users WHERE center_id = OLD.center_id AND role = DIRECTOR AND status = ACTIVE ORDER BY id FOR UPDATE' + 1500ms lock_timeout, tested with 2-connection concurrency barrier (DB-IT-19, AUTH-IT-11).",
    "F09: Enforced relational student/enrollment/group/lesson/invoice/payment/allocation/credit/ledger lineage via composite FKs and eduerp_enforce_relational_lineage() triggers across 11 tables (DB-IT-08/15/16/17).",
    "F10: Changed client_operation_logs primary key to composite (center_id, actor_id, operation_type, client_operation_uuid) across schema.prisma, migration.sql, and idempotency.ts (DB-IT-13, AUTH-IT-08)."
  ],
